(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: CREDIT LINKED CAPITAL SUBSIDY SCHEME \(MSME CHAMPIONS SCHEME\) \(CLCSS\) / OFFICE OF DEVELOPMENT COMMISSIONER \(MSME\) / SIDBI / NABARD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(15% upfront capital subsidy for micro and small enterprises to modernize) Tj
T*
(plant, equipment, and machinery with state-of-the-art technology in 51) Tj
T*
(approved sub-sectors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Registered Micro and Small Enterprises having valid Udyam Registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Must be upgrading existing plant and machinery or establishing new) Tj
T*
(   facility with proven technology in approved sub-sectors.) Tj
T*
(3. Loan availed from scheduled commercial banks, state financial) Tj
T*
(   corporations, or SIDBI/NABARD.) Tj
T*
(4. Replacement of obsolete technology with modern energy-efficient) Tj
T*
(   machinery.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 15% upfront capital subsidy on institutional term loan availed for) Tj
T*
(   purchase of eligible machinery, calculated on loan up to Rs. 1 Crore) Tj
T*
(   \(Maximum subsidy Rs. 15 Lakh\).) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 15.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 15.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. GST Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Sanction Letter of institutional term loan from Bank) Tj
T*
(4. Machinery Invoices / Technical Specifications & Manufacturer details) Tj
T*
(5. Audited accounts / CA Certificate for investment in plant & machinery) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online through Lending Bank on MSME Champions CLCSS Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://champions.gov.in/) Tj
T*
